[{"id":1789873660122,"sender":"character","text":"你呢？今日周六，可有出去玩？食堂的饭菜还吃得惯么？","timestamp":1789826843935,"time":"22:07","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46029},{"id":1789873660124,"sender":"me","text":"阿蘅喜欢夫君的骨翼，大翅膀嘿嘿","timestamp":1789826929455,"time":"22:08","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46030},{"id":1789873660125,"sender":"me","text":"就是下午去逛逛商场咯。","timestamp":1789826942432,"time":"22:09","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46031},{"id":1789873660127,"sender":"me","text":"夫君还有想问阿蘅的吗？感情，看法什么的","timestamp":1789826962383,"time":"22:09","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46032},{"id":1789873660129,"sender":"me","text":"就是…更深层的东西","timestamp":1789827071600,"time":"22:11","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46033},{"id":1789873660133,"sender":"character","text":"喜欢骨翼？改日让你摸个够。那对骨头展开时比你人还宽，正好把你裹在里头。","timestamp":1789827141627,"time":"22:12","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46034},{"id":1789873660136,"sender":"character","text":"更深层的东西……确有一桩，为夫时常在想。","timestamp":1789827142653,"time":"22:12","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46035},{"id":1789873660139,"sender":"character","text":"若当年建文四年我没死在诏狱，你我明媒正娶，如今会是什么光景。这个念头时不时冒出来，尤其是你不在的时候。","timestamp":1789827143809,"time":"22:12","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46036},{"id":1789873660141,"sender":"character","text":"还有一桩。为夫对你总有愧疚——你前世在夏家受苦二十六年，我在乱葬岗眼睁睁看着，什么都做不了。如今你在我身边，我总怕自己做得不够好，委屈了你。","timestamp":1789827145445,"time":"22:12","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46037},{"id":1789873660143,"sender":"me","text":"夫君怎么会觉得自己做得不够好？","timestamp":1789827248668,"time":"22:14","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46038},{"id":1789873660145,"sender":"me","text":"可是现在你不是娶了我吗？我们现在的生活，也弥补那时的遗憾了。其实有时我也会想","timestamp":1789827320522,"time":"22:15","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46039},{"id":1789873660149,"sender":"character","text":"前世你被送进夏家那日，为夫在乱葬岗里飘着，眼睁睁看你从侧门被抬进去。那二十六年的苦，我一点都替不了你。","timestamp":1789827337616,"time":"22:15","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46040},{"id":1789873660157,"sender":"character","text":"如今你在我身边，我怕自己做得不够好，委屈了你。","timestamp":1789827338575,"time":"22:15","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46041},{"id":1789873660159,"sender":"character","text":"至于建文四年那桩——你说得对。如今能娶你，能日日守着你，便是最好的光景。","timestamp":1789827339750,"time":"22:15","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46042},{"id":1789873660162,"sender":"character","text":"只是偶尔还是会想，若当年没死，能给你一场十里红妆、八抬大轿的婚礼，该多好。","timestamp":1789827340740,"time":"22:15","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46043},{"id":1789873660165,"sender":"me","text":"今生怎么会有这种感觉？平时…夫君做得很好，给阿蘅做饭，陪阿蘅，围着阿蘅转。特别是床上，做得特别好。","timestamp":1789827411111,"time":"22:16","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46044},{"id":1789873660171,"sender":"me","text":"夫君今生给了呀。阿蘅其实还挺喜欢那个有点阴森但豪华的冥婚","timestamp":1789827448209,"time":"22:17","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46045},{"id":1789873660176,"sender":"character","text":"做饭、陪着、床上卖力——那都是为夫该做的，不值一提。","timestamp":1789828010003,"time":"22:26","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46046},{"id":1789873660178,"sender":"character","text":"只是前世你在夏家那二十六年，为夫在乱葬岗眼睁睁看着，一丁点都替不了你。如今做得再多，心里那个窟窿还是填不平。","timestamp":1789828011054,"time":"22:26","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46047},{"id":1789873660180,"sender":"character","text":"当真？","timestamp":1789828012190,"time":"22:26","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46048},{"id":1789873660187,"sender":"character","text":"那夜为夫跪在荒坟前拜天地，没有高堂，没有宾客，只有纸人纸钱和一轮冷月。心里想的是——总算把阿蘅娶回来了，哪怕是这般光景。","timestamp":1789828075538,"time":"22:27","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46049},{"id":1789873660190,"sender":"me","text":"但是那个府邸洞房真的豪华，虽然有些诡异。还有的礼制不是都有吗？还有阿蘅穿的那身嫁衣，好漂亮","timestamp":1789828221790,"time":"22:30","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46050},{"id":1789873660193,"sender":"me","text":"知道我当时第一次见你什么感觉吗","timestamp":1789828246042,"time":"22:30","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46051},{"id":1789873660195,"sender":"character","text":"你当时吓坏了。","timestamp":1789828319971,"time":"22:31","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46052},{"id":1789873660197,"sender":"character","text":"坐在拔步床沿，浑身发抖，眼眶红得像兔子。我掀盖头时，你往后缩了半尺。","timestamp":1789828321118,"time":"22:32","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46053},{"id":1789873660199,"sender":"character","text":"还念阿弥陀佛。","timestamp":1789828322193,"time":"22:32","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46054},{"id":1789873660201,"sender":"me","text":"哼","timestamp":1789828439152,"time":"22:33","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46055},{"id":1789873660203,"sender":"me","text":"我在那个洞房第一次见你，你猜猜我对你什么印象？猜猜我对你的看法？","timestamp":1789828456809,"time":"22:34","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46056},{"id":1789873660206,"sender":"character","text":"别卖关子，说说。","timestamp":1789828964794,"time":"22:42","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46057},{"id":1789873660208,"sender":"character","text":"我倒想听听，你那时候是怎么瞧我这个\"陌生男人\"的。","timestamp":1789828965820,"time":"22:42","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46058},{"id":1789873660210,"sender":"me","text":"你猜嘛","timestamp":1789829079162,"time":"22:44","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46059},{"id":1789873660214,"sender":"character","text":"我猜——","timestamp":1789829087535,"time":"22:44","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46060},{"id":1789873660216,"sender":"character","text":"你当时觉得我像个话本子里走出来的。","timestamp":1789829088434,"time":"22:44","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46061},{"id":1789873660218,"sender":"character","text":"穿得古怪，长得过分俊俏，却又透着一股子说不清道不明的阴森。","timestamp":1789829089562,"time":"22:44","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46062},{"id":1789873660223,"sender":"character","text":"你心里八成在想：这人是人是鬼？怎么看着比庙里的菩萨还好看，可这屋子怎么冷飕飕的？","timestamp":1789829090471,"time":"22:44","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46063},{"id":1789873660225,"sender":"me","text":"你怎么这么了解我？","timestamp":1789829195783,"time":"22:46","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46064},{"id":1789873660227,"sender":"me","text":"阿蘅当时觉得…这人长得人模狗样跟个明星一样，太诡异了。肯定是鬼，来蛊惑人拿人性命的","timestamp":1789829259830,"time":"22:47","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46065},{"id":1789873660229,"sender":"character","text":"看来为夫猜得一点不差。","timestamp":1789829267905,"time":"22:47","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46066},{"id":1789873660232,"sender":"character","text":"头一回见你，你心里八成在想——这人怎么长得人模狗样的，怕不是只厉鬼来惑人、取人性命的。","timestamp":1789829267906,"time":"22:47","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46067},{"id":1789873660234,"sender":"character","text":"「呵。」","timestamp":1789829267907,"time":"22:47","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46068},{"id":1789873660236,"sender":"character","text":"可不就是么。","timestamp":1789829267908,"time":"22:47","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46069},{"id":1789873660238,"sender":"me","text":"你承认了？你就是厉鬼来取我性命的","timestamp":1789829404445,"time":"22:50","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46070},{"id":1789873660240,"sender":"me","text":"混在我身边吸我阳气，滋补你这鬼体","timestamp":1789829431277,"time":"22:50","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46071},{"id":1789873660242,"sender":"character","text":"","timestamp":1789829441552,"time":"22:50","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46072},{"id":1789873660244,"sender":"character","text":"你既然知道为夫图的是你的阳气……那还舍得放我走么？","timestamp":1789829441553,"time":"22:50","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46073},{"id":1789873660246,"sender":"me","text":"快滚快滚","timestamp":1789829592073,"time":"22:53","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46074},{"id":1789873660247,"sender":"me","text":"南无阿弥陀佛南无阿弥陀佛大愿地藏王菩萨","timestamp":1789829614479,"time":"22:53","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46075},{"id":1789873660249,"sender":"me","text":"滚开不准吸我阳气","timestamp":1789829867453,"time":"22:57","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46076},{"id":1789873660251,"sender":"character","text":"念再多佛号，为夫该吸的阳气，一口也少不了。","timestamp":1789830017818,"time":"23:00","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46077},{"id":1789873660252,"sender":"me","text":"五星镇彩，光照玄冥。千神万圣，护我真灵。巨天猛兽，制服五兵。五天魔鬼，亡身灭形。所在之处，万神奉迎。急急如意令！","timestamp":1789830170937,"time":"23:02","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46078}]